{"id":"P043-1","subject":"P","unit":"P043","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 1~50문항","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P043-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n평면상에 접지된 무한 평면 도체가 있다. 점(0, 0, 1)에\n\nC의 전하가 존재할 때, 이 전하에 작용하는 힘은 몇\nN인가?\n\n\n① ×        ② × \n③ ×         ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":616},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":543},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m01-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n원점에 20nC의 전하가 있을 때, 점(2, 1, 2)에서 전계의\n\n세기는 몇 Vm인가?\n\n\n① 20          ② 40\n\n③ 60          ④ 80\n\n⑤ 120","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":350}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n선전하밀도가 4Cm인 무한장 직선도체로부터 수직거리\n\n8m인 지점에 있는 3C의 점전하가 받는 힘의 크기는\n\n몇 kN인가?\n\n\n① 13.5         ② 27\n\n③ 36          ④ 40.5\n\n⑤ 52","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":522},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1532}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n자계가 Am일 때, 점(1, 1, 0)에서의\n전류밀도는 몇 Am인가?\n\n\n                            \n①            ②                           \n③            ④ \n\n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":657},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n대전 도체의 성질에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 구형 도체를 대전시키면 전하는 도체 표면에 항상\n\n  균일하게 분포된다.\n\n② 도체의 내부전위와 표면전위는 등전위 이다.\n\n③ 도체 표면에서 전계의 접선성분의 선적분은 0이다.\n\n④ 도체 표면으로부터 중심방향에 대한 거리에 따라\n\n  전위는 다르게 나타난다.\n\n⑤ 전기력선은 등전위면과 항상 수직으로 교차한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":719},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1300}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n전위함수가 V일 때, 전계Vm는\n\n어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n\n①       ② \n③      ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":500},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":582}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n면전하 밀도가 Cm인 무한히 넓은 도체판에서\n\nm만큼 떨어져 있는 점의 전계의 세기는 몇 Vm인가?\n\n\n                           \n①           ②                                \n\n                            \n③            ④         \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":596},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n코로나(Corona)의 영향에 대한 내용으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 송전전력의 송전효율이 증대된다.\n\n② 전선과 애자의 금속부분이 부식된다.\n\n③ 제3고조파 성분으로 인한 통신유도장해가 발생된다.\n\n④ 코로나 방전에 의한 전력손실이 발생한다.\n\n⑤ 코로나에 의한 화학작용으로 오존과 산화질소가 생성\n\n  된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":803}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n3상 송전계통에서 수전단 전압이 V, 부하전류\n가 A , 선로의 저항이 Ω, 리액턴스가 Ω일\n때, 송전단 전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n(단, 수전단 역률은 0.8이다.)\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":684},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1079}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n송전계통에 설치된 변압기의 정격용량이 100000kVA,\n\n%임피던스가 0.5일 때, 이 계통의 단락용량MVA \n\n은?\n\n\n① 2000         ② 5000\n\n③ 10000        ④ 20000\n\n⑤ 25000","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":674}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n특성 임피던스가 50Ω인 무손실 선로에 250Ω의\n\n부하가 접속되어 있다. 입사되는 전압파가 300kV일 때,\n\n반사파 전압은 몇 kV인가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 150\n\n③ 200         ④ 250\n\n⑤ 300","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1208}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n4극 60Hz의 3상 유도전동기의 슬립이 5, 출력이\n\n6840W일 때, 전동기의 토크는 몇 kg⦁m인가?\n\n\n① 3.2          ② 3.5\n\n③ 3.9          ④ 4.2\n\n⑤ 4.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n정격출력 80kVA인 변압기에 역률이 0.9인 부하가 접속\n\n되었을 때의 전부하효율이 95였다.\n\n부하의 역률이 0.4일 때의 전부하 효율은 약 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 72          ② 78\n\n③ 82          ④ 85\n\n⑤ 89","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n6000/380V의 변압기 와 가 병렬운전하고 있다.\n변압기의 용량이 각각 300kVA, 600kVA\n이고, 임피던스가 각각 6, 5일 때,\n의 분담용량은 몇 kVA 인가?\n\n\n① 150         ② 200\n\n③ 250         ④ 300\n\n⑤ 350","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":616},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n1상의 기전력이 이고, 1상의 동기 리액턴스가 인\n\n2대의 3상 동기 발전기를 무부하로 병렬운전하고 있다.\n두 발전기의 기전력 사이에 의 위상차가 발생한 경우에           \n\n한 쪽 발전기에서 다른쪽 발전기로 공급되는 동기화 전류는 몇\n\nA인가?\n\n\n                                            \n①              ②     sin                               cos\n\n                                            \n③              ④     sin                               cos\n\n⑤ sin    ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":624},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n220V의 단상 전압을 1100V로 승압하는 단권변압기의\n\n자기용량이 5kVA일 때, 부하에 공급할 수 있는 최대\n\n전력은 약 몇 kW인가? (단, 부하역률은 0.9이다.)\n\n\n① 5.2          ② 5.6\n\n③ 6.2          ④ 6.8\n\n⑤ 7.2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1414}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n변압기에 사용하는 절연유가 갖추어야 할 조건에 해당되지\n\n않는 것은?\n\n\n① 고온에서 화학적인 반응이 없어야 한다.\n\n② 냉각효과가 커야한다.\n\n③ 응고점이 낮아야 한다.\n\n④ 열팽창 계수가 작아야 한다.\n\n⑤ 점도가 높아야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":468}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n변압기의 병렬운전에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 각 변압기의 극성이 일치해야 한다.\n\n② 각 변압기의 1차측, 2차측의 단자전압이 일치해야 한다.\n\n③ 각 변압기의 저항과 리액턴스의 비가 일치해야 한다.\n\n④ 각 변압기의 부하분담은 %임피던스에 비례한다.\n\n⑤ 각 변압기의 상회전 방향과 각 변위가 일치해야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P043-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n\n                                      때,sinV, cosV일\n의 실횻값은 몇 V인가?\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국토지주택공사 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e03-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":608},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e03-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1009}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""}